    <dashboard _.fcp.AccessibleZoneTabOrder.true...enable-sort-zone-taborder='true' name='Glossary and Explanations'>
      <repository-location derived-from='https://tableau.deliveryhero.net/t/GlobalStandardReporting/workbooks/ABCs2024/GlossaryandExplanations?rev=' id='GlossaryandExplanations' path='/t/GlobalStandardReporting/workbooks/ABCs2024' revision='' site='GlobalStandardReporting' />
      <style>
        <style-rule element='dash-text'>
          <format attr='vertical-align' id='dash-text_6' value='top' />
        </style-rule>
      </style>
      <size maxheight='800' maxwidth='1500' minheight='800' minwidth='1500' sizing-mode='fixed' />
      <zones>
        <zone h='100000' id='4' type-v2='layout-basic' w='100000' x='0' y='0'>
          <zone forceUpdate='true' h='10875' id='5' type-v2='text' w='85464' x='14003' y='1000'>
            <formatted-text>
              <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Tableau Bold' fontsize='14'>ABCs 2024 | Explanations and Glossary</run>
            </formatted-text>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin' value='0' />
              <format attr='background-color' value='#d61f26' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
          <zone forceUpdate='true' h='87125' id='6' type-v2='text' w='98934' x='533' y='11875'>
            <formatted-text>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>This dashboard is to track DH yearly ABC targets and actuals. </run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>Deepdives per entity on monthly and quarterly evolution can be found in the respected pages. </run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>Beware:</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>- </run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>KPI aggregations</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'> can differ: End of Quarter, Quarterly Avg, Quarterly Sum [ </run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10' italic='true'>see details in Entity-Metric Glossary</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'> ] </run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>- Target calculations can differ: </run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>Incremental</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'> (vs Baseline Q3&apos;2023) or </run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>Seasonal</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'> (Act vs Target)  [ </run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10' italic='true'>see details in Entity-Metric Glossary</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'> ] </run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>- Not all entities are included in global commitments and entites have differing commitments. In order to reflect that please use the filter on </run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>Global/Entity specific commitment</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'> type filter.  [ </run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10' italic='true'>see details in Entity-Metric Glossary</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'> ] </run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>- Data </run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>access is only for Regional/Central users</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>. Country level data is not shown in this dashboard.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>Data Access to pages:</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>There is a hierarchical user access level given to each user.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>- For a user to be able to see data, that user needs to have access to all countries inside that entity. </run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10' underline='true'>Users which don&apos;t have regional access there will be no data in the dashboard!</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>- Same logic is used for DH level aggregation. Only users with access to all DH entities will be able to see DH Total/Central values. </run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>Data refresh and granularity:</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>- Due to the nature of KPIs some are updated quarterly and will not be shown in the monthly performance. They will only be available in quarterly views.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>- Some KPIs are updated manually and go through manual effort, in the beginning of the quarter these KPIs will take time to be updated. You can check which are manual/automatic from Enitity-Metric Glossary</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>Dashboard Pages:</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10' underline='true'>- Summary - One pager:</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'> This is a one pager summary of aggregated Target achievement percentages.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10' underline='true'>- Big Bets Quarterly Evolution</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>:</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'> This page enables a deep dive of how the aggregated Target achievement scores are being calculated. Users can deep dive on individual commitments.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10' underline='true'>- ABC Commitments - Quarterly Evolution:</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10' underline='true'>Æ </run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>This page gives the detail of Quarterly evolution taking in to account Q3&apos;23 Baseline, Targets and Actuals. </run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10' underline='true'>- ABC Commitments - Monthly Evolution:</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10' underline='true'>Æ </run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>This page gives the detail of Monthly performance for monthly available kpis. No targets or target achievement since there are no Monthly Targets. </run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10' underline='true'>- Entity-Metric Glossary:</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10' underline='true'>Æ </run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>This page maps the commitments on their respective calculation KPI, Target achievement logic, Commitment owner, and source.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>You can see the Targets Achievement calculation cases in the following document</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>- </run>
              <run auto-url='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10' hyperlink='tabdoc:load-url url=&amp;quot;https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1gCGzI1LIBVfsmvKZp5O0Cde0j2iJZ--GZanBe-a2fQA&amp;quot;'>https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1gCGzI1LIBVfsmvKZp5O0Cde0j2iJZ--GZanBe-a2fQA</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>If you have further questions/feedback please feel free to reachout </run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>#data-hub-intl-markets</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'> or Egemen  Can Gok, Amy Nguyen, Kaya Anil Uckunkaya</run>
            </formatted-text>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin' value='4' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
          <zone h='10875' id='7' is-scaled='1' param='Image/Delivery-Hero-Logo.png' type-v2='bitmap' w='13470' x='533' y='1000'>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin' value='0' />
              <format attr='background-color' value='#d61f26' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
          <zone-style>
            <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
            <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
            <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
            <format attr='margin' value='8' />
          </zone-style>
        </zone>
      </zones>
